<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Pernod.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Pernod.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Finance (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 1.50 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Pernod Ricard SA, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	    STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A		255.00 FRF	5.21 FRF</p>
<p> CALL B		285.00 FRF	3.59 FRF</p>
<p> CALL C		315.00 FRF	2.48 FRF</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 09.DEC.96-26.MAY.98   PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
